WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.077
- So Ben and I were just
walking around Rite Aid

00:00:03.077 --> 00:00:06.586
and found Reese's Crunchy Cookie!

00:00:06.586 --> 00:00:08.495
Which I have never seen,
apparently they came out

00:00:08.495 --> 00:00:10.361
like mid-May of this year?

00:00:10.361 --> 00:00:12.030
- Yeah.
- But it's new to both of us.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.199
- Never seen it before,

00:00:13.199 --> 00:00:16.720
super excited, cookies and Reese's?

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.703
The best things in the world!

00:00:18.703 --> 00:00:21.286
(upbeat music)

00:00:23.584 --> 00:00:24.667
- What is it?

00:00:25.927 --> 00:00:27.177
Crunchy cookie?

00:00:28.049 --> 00:00:31.252
- I'm honestly kind of
tearing up! (laughs)

00:00:31.252 --> 00:00:32.387
- Can we eat it?

00:00:32.387 --> 00:00:34.178
- I feel like this is a trick.

00:00:34.178 --> 00:00:35.749
- This just smells like glory.

00:00:35.749 --> 00:00:38.323
(exclaims) I'm sorry!
The chocolate came off

00:00:38.323 --> 00:00:39.596
and I saw the inside.
- Ah.

00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:41.144
- I think my mouth is already watering.

00:00:41.144 --> 00:00:42.703
Give it to me. (laughs)

00:00:42.703 --> 00:00:44.911
- You've gotta bite it at the same time.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:45.921
- Oh my God.

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:48.421
(brass music)

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:01.513
- Oh my God! (laughter)

00:01:02.749 --> 00:01:05.422
- Mm. Oh my God, I love it.

00:01:05.422 --> 00:01:07.011
Some mad genius thought of this.

00:01:07.011 --> 00:01:09.003
I don't know if I can go
back to regular Reese's.

00:01:09.003 --> 00:01:11.053
- Look at the tiny chocolate chips!

00:01:11.053 --> 00:01:13.031
It's everything Reese's was missing,

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:14.831
but you never knew you needed.

00:01:14.831 --> 00:01:17.811
- Dude. The crunch changes everything.

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:19.179
It tastes like cookie dough.

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:20.372
- I love everything about this.

00:01:20.372 --> 00:01:21.382
- Thank you, Reese's.

00:01:21.382 --> 00:01:22.891
Send some more to the BuzzFeed office.

00:01:22.891 --> 00:01:24.478
- Please! (laughter)

00:01:24.478 --> 00:01:26.487
- You've outdone yourself, Reese's.

00:01:26.487 --> 00:01:27.443
- I think I don't like when people mess

00:01:27.443 --> 00:01:29.926
with a good thing, but like.

00:01:29.926 --> 00:01:30.759
- That was so good.

00:01:30.759 --> 00:01:31.763
I'm really sad that it's over.

00:01:31.763 --> 00:01:33.072
This is gonna be the new standard

00:01:33.072 --> 00:01:34.472
for my Reese's consumption, like,

00:01:34.472 --> 00:01:35.766
I don't think I could go back.

00:01:35.766 --> 00:01:39.599
- Final thoughts: Keep
killin' the game, girl.

